Note on the SPDX headers

Every file in this repository is licensed under the MIT License above, except
the dependencies under lib/, which keep their own licenses.

Five core contracts still carry the header "SPDX-License-Identifier: BUSL-1.1"
from before they were relicensed under MIT:

  src/TokenFactory.sol
  src/LaunchToken.sol
  src/BondingCurveManager.sol
  src/LiquidityMigrator.sol
  src/StockReserve.sol

Those headers are left unchanged only so that these files stay identical to the
source verified on MonadVision and Monadscan for the contracts deployed on Monad
mainnet. For these files too, the MIT License above applies and replaces the
Business Source License.
